{"availability":"available","full":"nivasthumma/MerchOPsaI","name":"MerchOPsaI","description":"🛡️ AI payments-operations control plane: detect → investigate → policy → human approval → act → verify → reconcile. The model reasons; deterministic controls hold authority. UNKNOWN is never retried, tenant isolation is enforced in Postgres, replay has zero side effects. 1,300+ tests · 187 scenarios · mutation-tested · live demo.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-25T09:12:40Z","updated":"2026-10-06T16:40:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://merchantops-agent.vercel.app","topics":["ai-agents","evaluation","fastapi","fintech","human-in-the-loop","idempotency","llm","mutation-testing","payments","policy-engine","postgresql","razorpay","react","reconciliation","row-level-security","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://merchantops-agent.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:54.600Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:54.600Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:54.600Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:54.600Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( [](LICENSE) []( []( [](#-measured-results) [](#-measured-results) [](#-measured-results)","An AI agent that investigates merchant payment and revenue problems, recommends a corrective action, and — only with human approval — executes it through a controlled tool, then independently verifies what actually happened.","Independent developer project. Uses Razorpay Test Mode APIs where applicable. Not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Razorpay."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nivasthumma/MerchOPsaI/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"e6947ea4049295513fd4785ca76799312814d8fe2bcd3685378ce256425928ac","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:54.806Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:54.806Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( [](LICENSE) []( []( [](#-measured-results) [](#-measured-results) [](#-measured-results)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nivasthumma/MerchOPsaI/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"No Anthropic credential of any kind is present here — not an API key, an auth token, an ant auth login profile, or workload identity — so the agent runs on DeterministicProvider, a rule-based planner rather than a language model.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nivasthumma/MerchOPsaI/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"No Anthropic credential of any kind is present here — not an API key, an auth token, an ant auth login profile, or workload identity — so the agent runs on DeterministicProvider, a rule-based planner rather than a language model.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nivasthumma/MerchOPsaI/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"What is still missing: SAML (it needs xmlsec and a native build, so a SAML-only customer can be deprovisioned but cannot sign in), SCIM Groups, MFA, per-device sessions — \"sign out my old phone\" means signing out everywhere — and the token still lives in localStorage where any script on the origin can read it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nivasthumma/MerchOPsaI/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e6947ea4049295513fd4785ca76799312814d8fe2bcd3685378ce256425928ac","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nivasthumma/MerchOPsaI/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:54.807Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T16:40:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nivasthumma/MerchOPsaI/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:54.809Z","hash":"e6947ea4049295513fd4785ca76799312814d8fe2bcd3685378ce256425928ac","originalBytes":63702,"storedBytes":63702,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["one","make","run","rather","test","what","which","two","get",